| Replace stale instructions and repair the sentence | Prevents duplicate or ambiguous work | Frame, progression note |
| Retain four units and 30 sessions | No allocation change is necessary for these repairs | No change |

## What I could not judge

The library lesson pages, final source passages, assessment forms, scoring samples and accessibility treatments are not yet available. Actual reading load, scoring reliability and administration time therefore remain unverified. The timing repairs above are planning allocations, not demonstrated classroom results.

## Sources and evidence limits

- [AASL learner framework, second edition](https://standards.aasl.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/250918-AASL-framework-for-learners.pdf): checked the owned competencies, particularly IV.B.3 and authentic-audience sharing.
